    {
      "source": "Annotation to automatically register the following beans for usage with Spring MVC. Note that using this annotation\nwill require Spring 3.2.\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../../repository/support/DomainClassConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>DomainClassConverter</code></a> - to allow usage of domain types managed\nby Spring Data repositories as controller method arguments bound with\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/bind/annotation/PathVariable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>PathVariable</code></a> or\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/bind/annotation/RequestParam.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>RequestParam</code></a>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"../PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> - to allow injection of\n<a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> instances into controller methods automatically created from request\nparameters.</li>\n<li><a href=\"../SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> - to allow injection of\n<a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> instances into controller methods automatically created from request\nparameters.</li>\n</ul>\nIf Spring HATEOAS is present on the classpath we will register the following beans:\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../HateoasPageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>HateoasPageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> - instead of\n<a href=\"../PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../HateoasSortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>HateoasSortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> - instead of\n<a href=\"../SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../PagedResourcesAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PagedResourcesAssembler</code></a> - for injection into web components</li>\n<li><a href=\"../SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> - for injection of\n<a href=\"../PagedResourcesAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PagedResourcesAssembler</code></a> into controller methods</li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "用于自动注册以下 Bean 以便与 Spring MVC 一起使用的注解。请注意，使用此注解需要 Spring 3.2 版本。\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../../repository/support/DomainClassConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.repository.support\"><code>DomainClassConverter</code></a> - 允许将 Spring Data 仓库管理的域类型用作与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/bind/annotation/PathVariable.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>PathVariable</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/bind/annotation/RequestParam.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>RequestParam</code></a> 绑定的控制器方法参数。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> - 允许自动将 <a href=\"../../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> 实例注入到从请求参数创建的控制器方法中。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> - 允许自动将 <a href=\"../../domain/Sort.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Sort</code></a> 实例注入到从请求参数创建的控制器方法中。</li>\n</ul>\n如果类路径中存在 Spring HATEOAS，我们将注册以下 Bean：\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"../HateoasPageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>HateoasPageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> - 替代 <a href=\"../PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PageableHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../HateoasSortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>HateoasSortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> - 替代 <a href=\"../SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../PagedResourcesAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PagedResourcesAssembler</code></a> - 用于注入到 Web 组件中</li>\n<li><a href=\"../SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>SortHandlerMethodArgumentResolver</code></a> - 用于将 <a href=\"../PagedResourcesAssembler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web\"><code>PagedResourcesAssembler</code></a> 注入到控制器方法中</li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configures how to render <a href=\"../../domain/PageImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>PageImpl</code></a> instances. Defaults to\n<a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.html#DIRECT\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.DIRECT</code></a> for backward compatibility reasons. Prefer explicitly setting this to\n<a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.html#VIA_DTO\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.VIA_DTO</code></a>, or manually convert <a href=\"../../domain/PageImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>PageImpl</code></a>\ninstances before handing them out of a controller method, either by manually calling <code>new PagedModel&lt;&gt;(page)</code>\nor using Spring HATEOAS <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/PagedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>PagedModel</code></a> abstraction.",
      "translation": "配置如何渲染 <a href=\"../../domain/PageImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>PageImpl</code></a> 实例。出于向后兼容的考虑，默认值为 <a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.html#DIRECT\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.DIRECT</code></a>。建议显式将其设置为 <a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.html#VIA_DTO\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport.PageSerializationMode.VIA_DTO</code></a>，或者在从控制器方法返回之前手动转换 <a href=\"../../domain/PageImpl.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>PageImpl</code></a> 实例，可以通过手动调用 <code>new PagedModel&lt;&gt;(page)</code> 或使用 Spring HATEOAS 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/PagedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>PagedModel</code></a> 抽象来实现。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Registers a bean definition for <a href=\"SpringDataWebSettings.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>SpringDataWebSettings</code></a> carrying the configuration values of\n<a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport</code></a>.",
      "translation": "注册一个用于承载 <a href=\"EnableSpringDataWebSupport.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>EnableSpringDataWebSupport</code></a> 配置值的 <a href=\"SpringDataWebSettings.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>SpringDataWebSettings</code></a> Bean 定义。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Import selector to register <a href=\"QuerydslWebConfiguration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.web.config\"><code>QuerydslWebConfiguration</code></a> as configuration class if Querydsl is on the\nclasspath.",
